  <span><strong>Date:</strong> {{date_today}}</span>
</div>

<div class="doc-title">MARINE SURVEY REPORT</div>
<div class="doc-sub">(WITHOUT PREJUDICE)</div>

<div class="to-block">
  <strong>The Manager,</strong><br/>
  {{claim.insurer_name}}<br/>
  {{narrative.insurer_office_address}}
</div>

<div class="subject">
  <strong>Subject:</strong> Survey of consignment of LR No. {{narrative.lr_no}} dated {{narrative.lr_date}}
  (Vehicle No. {{narrative.vehicle_no}})<br/>
  <span class="small">Policy No: {{claim.policy_number}} &nbsp;||&nbsp; Insured: {{claim.insured_name}} &nbsp;||&nbsp; Claim No: {{claim.claim_number}}</span>
</div>

<p>Dear Sir,</p>
<p>Pursuant to valued instruction received from {{narrative.instructions_received_from}} on
   {{claim.date_of_intimation}} for survey and loss assessment of the below mentioned claim,
   we have conducted the survey as per the details below.</p>

<table class="kv">
  <tr><td class="k">Instruction received from</td><td>{{narrative.instructions_received_from}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Date of Loss</td><td>{{claim.date_loss}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Date of Deputation</td><td>{{claim.date_of_intimation}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Date of Survey</td><td>{{narrative.dates_of_survey}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Place of Survey</td><td>{{narrative.place_of_survey}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Person Contacted</td><td>{{narrative.person_contacted}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Insured Name</td><td>{{claim.insured_name}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">LR No. / Shipment No.</td><td>{{narrative.lr_no}} dated {{narrative.lr_date}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Location / Transit</td><td>{{narrative.transit}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Estimated Loss Amount</td><td>{{loss_sheet.gross_loss_inr}}</td></tr>
</table>

<p>During our visit, we contacted the consignee&rsquo;s representative
   {{narrative.person_contacted}} who produced the damaged consignment for our inspection
   and described the situation of loss. Photographs of the damaged consignment were snapped
   from different angles bespeaking the damages. Now we are submitting our final survey and
   loss assessment report which is based on the following observations and documents
   provided.</p>

<h2>1. Policy Particulars</h2>
<table class="kv">
  <tr><td class="lbl">a</td><td class="k">Insurer</td><td>{{claim.insurer_name}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">b</td><td class="k">Policy No.</td><td>{{claim.policy_number}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">c</td><td class="k">Insured</td><td>{{claim.insured_name}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">d</td><td class="k">Type of Policy</td><td>{{claim.lob_subcategory}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">e</td><td class="k">Period of Insurance</td><td>{{claim.policy_period_from}} to {{claim.policy_period_to}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">f</td><td class="k">Sum Insured</td><td>{{loss_sheet.sum_insured_inr}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">g</td><td class="k">Basis of Valuation</td><td>{{narrative.basis_of_valuation}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">h</td><td class="k">Packing Description</td><td>{{narrative.policy_packing_description}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">i</td><td class="k">Transport Mode</td><td>{{narrative.transport_mode}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">j</td><td class="k">Commodity Description</td><td>{{narrative.commodity_description}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">k</td><td class="k">Journey Details</td><td>{{narrative.journey_details}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">l</td><td class="k">Policy Excess</td><td>{{narrative.policy_excess_text}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">m</td><td class="k">Risks Covered</td><td>{{narrative.risks_covered}}</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>2. Details of Consignment</h2>
<table class="kv">
  <tr><td class="lbl">a</td><td class="k">Carrier</td><td>{{narrative.carrier}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">b</td><td class="k">Consignor</td><td>{{narrative.consignor}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">c</td><td class="k">Consignee</td><td>{{narrative.consignee}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">d</td><td class="k">LR No. / Shipment No.</td><td>{{narrative.lr_no}} dated {{narrative.lr_date}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">e</td><td class="k">Description of Goods</td><td>{{narrative.goods_description}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">f</td><td class="k">Transit</td><td>{{narrative.transit}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">g</td><td class="k">Invoice Details</td><td>{{narrative.invoice_details}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">h</td><td class="k">Vehicle No.</td><td>{{narrative.vehicle_no}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">i</td><td class="k">Total Consignment Value</td><td>{{narrative.total_consignment_value_inr}}</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>3. Packing Description</h2>
<p>{{narrative.packing_description}}</p>

<h2>4. Sequence of Incident</h2>
<table class="kv">
  <tr><td class="lbl">a</td><td class="k">Date of Booking</td><td>{{narrative.date_of_booking}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="lbl">b</td><td class="k">Date of Arrival / Unloading</td><td>{{narrative.date_of_arrival}}</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>5. Situation of Loss</h2>
<p>{{narrative.situation_of_loss}}</p>

<h2>6. Our Observations / Findings / Survey</h2>
<p>{{narrative.observations}}</p>

<h2>7. Cause of Loss</h2>
<p>{{ila.preliminary_view}}</p>

<h2>8. Insured&rsquo;s Claim</h2>
<p>The insured has claimed a loss of <strong>{{narrative.insured_claim_amount_inr}}</strong>
   ({{narrative.insured_claim_amount_words}}).</p>

<h2>9. Assessment of Loss</h2>
<p>The loss has been assessed on the following basis:</p>
<ul class="small">
  <li>The damaged items were verified by us during the course of survey and considered accordingly.</li>
  <li>The rates have been considered as per documents (invoices) provided by the insured / consignee.</li>
  <li>{{narrative.gst_treatment}}</li>
  <li>Basis of Valuation: {{narrative.basis_of_valuation}}</li>
  <li>Salvage: {{narrative.salvage_basis}}</li>
  <li>Excess: {{narrative.policy_excess_text}}</li>
</ul>

<table class="totals">
  <tr><td>Subtotal (damaged-qty × rate)</td><td class="num">{{loss_sheet.subtotal_inr}}</td></tr>
  <tr class="subtotal"><td>Add: Insurance @ {{loss_sheet.insurance_rate_pct}}%</td><td class="num">{{loss_sheet.insurance_total_inr}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Pre-GST Total</td><td class="num">{{loss_sheet.pre_gst_inr}}</td></tr>
  <tr class="subtotal"><td>Add: GST @ {{loss_sheet.gst_rate_pct}}%</td><td class="num">{{loss_sheet.gst_amount_inr}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Sub-Total (after GST)</td><td class="num">{{loss_sheet.after_gst_inr}}</td></tr>
  <tr class="subtotal"><td>Add: {{loss_sheet.handling_label}} @ {{loss_sheet.handling_rate_pct}}%</td><td class="num">{{loss_sheet.handling_amount_inr}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Gross Assessed Loss</td><td class="num">{{loss_sheet.gross_loss_inr}}</td></tr>
  <tr class="subtotal"><td>Less: Salvage</td><td class="num">{{loss_sheet.salvage_inr}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Net Assessed Loss</td><td class="num">{{loss_sheet.net_loss_inr}}</td></tr>
  <tr class="subtotal"><td>Less: Policy Excess</td><td class="num">{{loss_sheet.excess_inr}}</td></tr>
  <tr class="grand"><td>Net Adjusted Loss</td><td class="num">{{loss_sheet.net_adjusted_loss_inr}}</td></tr>
</table>

<p>(<strong>{{loss_sheet.net_adjusted_loss_words}}</strong>) subject to policy terms,
   conditions and final approval by the insurer.</p>

<h2>10. Admissibility of Claim</h2>
<p>Based on the facts of the case, documents examined, and observations made during
   the survey, we are of the opinion that the reported loss is
   <strong>{{ila.admissibility_label}}</strong> under the policy, subject to terms,
   conditions, warranties and exclusions.</p>
<p>{{ila.admissibility_reasoning}}</p>

<h2>11. Consent of the Insured</h2>
<p>{{narrative.consent_of_insured}}</p>

<h2>12. Recommendation</h2>
<p>We hereby recommend to the insurers to kindly settle this claim by paying
   <strong>{{loss_sheet.net_adjusted_loss_inr}}</strong>
   ({{loss_sheet.net_adjusted_loss_words}}) to the insured.</p>

<h2>13. Recovery Rights</h2>
<table class="kv">
  <tr><td class="k">Any remarks on LR</td><td>{{narrative.lr_remarks}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Damage certificate obtained from carrier</td><td>{{narrative.damage_certificate}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Monetary claim lodged on carrier (Regd. A/D)</td><td>{{narrative.monetary_claim_status}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Probable cause of damage</td><td>{{narrative.probable_cause}}</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>14. Notes</h2>
<ol class="checklist">
  <li>No breach of warranty was observed during the course of survey.</li>
  <li>The loss falls within the policy period.</li>
  <li>The subject matter is covered under the policy.</li>
  <li>The loss has been caused by an insured peril.</li>
</ol>

<h2>15. Declaration</h2>
<p>We hereby declare that we have no interest in the subject matter in question and
   reported on as above. We are neither related to the insured nor the business —
   either by blood, business or shareholding of whatsoever nature.</p>

<p>This concludes our final survey and loss assessment report which is issued without
   prejudice and is subject to the terms and conditions of the policy of insurance issued
   to and held by the insured, reserving our rights to alter / amend unintended error,
   if any.</p>

<p class="small"><em>(For discretion of insurer &amp; their legal advisers only)</em></p>

<div class="signoff">
  <p style="margin-top: 22px;">
    <strong>Authorized Signatory</strong><br/>
    <strong>{{signer.name}}</strong> (Surveyor)<br/>
    IRDAI Licence: {{signer.license}}<br/>
    For Acuere Surveyors<br/>
    <span class="small">Date: {{date_today}}</span>
  </p>
</div>

<div class="footer">
  Generated by NISLA Portal &nbsp;·&nbsp; Surveyor reference {{claim.ref_number}}
</div>

<div class="annex">
  <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Annexure-A — Itemised Cargo Damage</h2>
  {{loss_items_table}}
  <p class="small" style="margin-top: 14px;">
    All amounts in INR. Quantities reflect the consignor&rsquo;s commercial invoice and
    were verified during the course of survey.
  </p>
</div>

</body>
</html>
$body$,
  'Real-sample-aligned (T-012, T-039)',
  true
)
