<div class="doc-sub">(WITHOUT PREJUDICE)</div>

<p><strong>To,</strong><br/>
   The Claim In-Charge<br/>
   {{claim.insurer_name}}<br/>
   {{narrative.insurer_office_address}}</p>

<p><strong>Subject:</strong> Preliminary loss advice — Extended Warranty claim<br/>
   <span class="small">Vehicle No: {{narrative.registration_no}} || VIN: {{narrative.vin}} || Policy No: {{claim.policy_number}} || Claim File No: {{claim.claim_number}}</span></p>

<p>Dear Sir,</p>
<p>Pursuant to your instructions received on {{claim.date_of_intimation}} we made
   immediate contact with the dealer / service centre and conducted a preliminary
   inspection of the affected vehicle. This Initial Loss Advice records our first-look
   findings; a full Final Survey Report will follow once the dealer completes diagnosis
   and produces the tax invoice for the repair.</p>

<h2>1. Claim Summary</h2>
<table class="kv">
  <tr><td class="k">Insurer</td><td>{{claim.insurer_name}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Insured</td><td>{{claim.insured_name}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Policy No.</td><td>{{claim.policy_number}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Plan</td><td>{{narrative.plan_name}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Customer Name</td><td>{{narrative.customer_name}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Vehicle / Reg No.</td><td>{{narrative.vehicle_make}} {{narrative.vehicle_model}} ({{narrative.registration_no}})</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">VIN / Chassis</td><td>{{narrative.vin}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Odometer Reading</td><td>{{narrative.odometer}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Date of Loss</td><td>{{claim.date_loss}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="k">Service Centre</td><td>{{narrative.service_centre}}</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>2. Customer Complaint</h2>
<p>{{narrative.customer_complaint}}</p>

<h2>3. Preliminary Findings</h2>
<p>{{narrative.preliminary_findings}}</p>

<h2>4. Coverage Position (Preliminary)</h2>
<p>Subject to confirmation against the policy annexure (vehicle declaration) and final
   review of the dealer&rsquo;s diagnosis, the affected components
   <strong>{{ila.preliminary_admissibility_label}}</strong> appear to fall within the
   cover provided under {{narrative.plan_name}}.</p>
<p>{{ila.admissibility_reasoning}}</p>

<h2>5. Estimated Loss Reserve</h2>
<p>Based on the dealer&rsquo;s preliminary diagnosis we recommend the insurer reserve
   approximately:</p>
<p class="reserve">{{loss_sheet.estimated_reserve_inr}}</p>
<p class="small">This is a preliminary, indicative figure only. The Net Adjusted Loss
   will be determined in the Final Survey Report after the dealer issues the tax
   invoice and we have re-inspected the repaired vehicle and the removed parts.</p>

<h2>6. Documents Pending</h2>
<p>{{narrative.documents_pending}}</p>

<h2>7. Next Steps</h2>
<p>{{narrative.next_steps}}</p>

<div class="signoff">
  <p style="margin-top: 22px;">
    <strong>Authorized Signatory</strong><br/>
    <strong>{{signer.name}}</strong> (Surveyor)<br/>
    IRDAI Licence: {{signer.license}}<br/>
    For {{company.name}}<br/>
    <span class="small">Date: {{date_today}}</span>
  </p>
</div>

<p class="small"><em>This Initial Loss Advice is issued without prejudice and is subject
   to the terms and conditions of the policy of insurance. The figures above are
   indicative; final assessment will be communicated via the Final Survey Report.</em></p>

<div class="footer">
  Generated by NISLA Portal &nbsp;·&nbsp; Surveyor reference {{claim.ref_number}}
</div>

</body>
</html>
$body$,
  'Initial Loss Advice — 72-hour preliminary',
  true
)
ON CONFLICT (company, lob, template_name, version) DO NOTHING;

